<title>TURKEY: Turk shares ease 0.58 pct on high interest rates.</title>
<headline>Turk shares ease 0.58 pct on high interest rates.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish stocks eased on Monday morning amid rising interest rates and higher inflation expectations, brokers say.</p>
<p>The IMKB National-100 eased 0.58 percent or 11 points to 1,878. Morning trade volume shrank to 5.04 trillion lira from Friday's 8.98 trillion.</p>
</text>
